# Goal: switch between diverged branches and clear staging on checkout.
I prelude1.inc
> branch other
<<<
+ f.txt wug.txt
+ g.txt notwug.txt
> add g.txt
<<<
> add f.txt
<<<
> commit "Main two files"
<<<
E f.txt
E g.txt
> checkout other
<<<
* f.txt
* g.txt
+ staged.txt wug2.txt
> add staged.txt
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
